  "sampleAnswer": "Boundary Value Analysis focuses on values at and around input boundaries because defects frequently occur there. If age must be 18–60, test 17, 18, 19, 59, 60, and 61, plus relevant invalid formats. Boundary selection should reflect the actual requirement.",
