  "sampleAnswer": "Common testing queries include SELECT with WHERE/ORDER BY, JOINs, GROUP BY/HAVING, COUNT/SUM/AVG, subqueries/CTEs, INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE in controlled test environments, and queries for duplicates or orphan records. Use read-only queries whenever possible against shared environments and never modify production data casually.",
