  "sampleAnswer": "Validate schema changes, row counts, checksums or aggregates, referential integrity, transformed values, null/default behavior, indexes, application compatibility, and performance. Compare source and target using deterministic samples plus full reconciliation where feasible, and test rollback/recovery.",
